# Checklist item 1: at ~320 px nothing may scroll horizontally — long assistant messages
# and tool output must wrap. Look at the screenshots for a horizontal scrollbar or clipped
# text; that is the failure mode of the chat panes.
#
# The chat is inside JCEF, so there is nothing to assert on here: read the PNGs.
toolwindow FoxxyCode
# The backend has to start and the SPA has to paint before a width says anything.
sleep 8
width 320
sleep 2
screenshot narrow-320px
width 550
sleep 2
screenshot narrow-550px
# Put the tool window back to a comfortable width for whatever runs next.
width 700
